  <description>The Securities and Exchange Commission today charged two foreign-operated, Colorado-incorporated entities, BG Wealth Sharing Ltd and DSJ Exchange Pty Ltd, for orchestrating a fraud scheme that used false SEC filings to boost confidence in their…</description>
  <pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:42:37 -0400</pubDate>
